message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below. This is a pre-publication research prototype."
title: "MAS-VCG: Coordination Vulnerability Concept discovery and protocol-level repair for multi-agent LLM systems"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-23
authors:
  - family-names: Mahmoud
    given-names: Ragab
abstract: >-
  Research code for studying protocol-level coordination vulnerabilities in
  multi-agent LLM systems built with AutoGen and CrewAI, and protocol-level
  patches as repairs. Pilot stage; empirical results are not yet published.
keywords:
  - multi-agent systems
  - LLM security
  - coordination protocols
  - AutoGen
  - CrewAI
